  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **White Freightliner Blues**: rare: 13 archived performances [2]\n- **wait in the truck terasa**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **I’m Blue, I’m Lonesome**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 4 archived performances [2]\n- **Gold Rush (3)**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 10 archived performances [2]\n- **I Haven’t Seen Mary in Years (3)**: rare: 9 archived performances [2]\n- **Funky Bitch (3)(4)**: rare: 5 archived performances [2]\n- **Fire (3)(4)**: rare: 7 archived performances [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **bmfs2019-11-14.four61ob.flac24** (recommended): audience recording; 23 songs; 149 min [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Notes list Stash Wyslouch, Sean Trishka and Anh Phung as guests joining Billy Strings on the set marked (3), from Gold Rush onward [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **bmfs2019-11-14.four61ob.flac24**: taped by four61ob; transferred by four61ob; source: AUD > Rode M5(ORTF) > Zoom H5 (24bit/96kHz) > SDHC card [1]. Also: Audience recording made with Rode M5 microphones in ORTF configuration into a Zoom H5, captured at 24-bit/96kHz on an SDHC card [1]",
